WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
This offline replay aligns the robot footage, local goals, route trace and scene notes.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The initial destination is the vending machine to the left of the white lockers.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.600
The user changes the destination from the vending machine to Lawson.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:34.000
X2 turns toward the lobby corridor. Its local goal appears in the top-right camera view.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:00.000
The lower-left map traces the route and displays distance and speed.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:16.000
X2 approaches the glass doors and leaves the lobby.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Outside, X2 turns right and follows the walkway toward the building that houses Lawson.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:06.000
X2 approaches a crossing used by pedestrians and cars.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:26.000
The local-goal panel displays “Stop” as a car passes in front of X2.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:37.000
X2 resumes walking, extending the recorded route.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:07.000
The Lawson sign enters the camera view and X2 turns toward the entrance.

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:23.900
X2 stops at the Lawson entrance. The replay shows 96.6 m traveled.
